<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 28.157 Barion Hex Mix</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Larson, Vernon E: Amer Gemcutter, Aug 96, p29</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Crown based on given instructions. Pavilion based on</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">retaining indices, but changing angles.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">67 facets + 6 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">6-fold symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.155  T/W = 0.650  U/W = 0.584</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.591 C/W = 0.099</tspan>
